<title>UK: Banco Cidade price $50 million eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>Banco Cidade price $50 million eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced earlier by joint lead managers Credit Agricole Indosuez and Cidade Capital Markets has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO CIDADE S.A.</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 COUPON    *8.75 PCT  MATURITY    28.JUL.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  99.95     PAY DATE    28.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.50	REOFFER    99.95     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> GOV LAW    UK	  PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST THREE YEARS THEN STEPS-UP TO 9.25 PCT TO</p>
<p>		 2002 WHEN STEPS-UP TO 9.50 PCT.</p>
<p>		 PUT AND CALL PRICE FOR YEAR THREE IS 99.20.</p>
<p>		 PUT AND CALL PRICE FOR YEAR FIVE IS 99.75.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
